🔹 HashMap

Hash table based.

Allows one null key, many null values.

No order guarantee.

🔹 LinkedHashMap

Maintains insertion order.

🔹 TreeMap

Sorted map (Red-Black Tree)

Uses compareTo() or Comparator.

Extra methods:

Method	Description
K firstKey()	First key
K lastKey()	Last key
K lowerKey(K key)	Key < given
K floorKey(K key)	Key ≤ given
K higherKey(K key)	Key > given
K ceilingKey(K key)	Key ≥ given
NavigableMap<K,V> subMap(...)	Range
NavigableMap<K,V> descendingMap()	Reverse order
⏳ 5️⃣ Interface — Queue<E> (FIFO)

Extends Collection, adds queue behavior.

Method	Description
